# Bennett Help

When you add, rename, move, or change how a Bennett-facing screen works, update `BENNETT_HELP_SECTIONS` in `js/game.js` in the same commit. That array paints `help.html` (search, table of contents, and articles).

Help is a top-right `help-launch` button on every screen. Off Help it opens `help.html` in a new tab. Do not put Help back in the HUD chip row. Do not dump Help copy onto This Week.

Cover: This Week, assignments (Started / Done / Edit), A little help, Needs you, Needs follow-up (Copy email, Snooze until), Trophy Room, Progress, Crew, Base Camp, Story, Messages, Khan, Play/egg, sign-in.

Do not document Parent desk, Admin, Locker refs, Site usage, or Connect in Bennett Help. Do not hide Parent desk or Admin on Me.

If Help copy is asserted in `scripts/check-content-library.js`, update those asserts with the feature.
